macOS Terminal.app themes for {{ theme.name }}. {{ theme.description }}

## Installation

1. Clone the repository:
   ```bash
   git clone https://github.com/{{ owner }}/{{ theme.id }}-terminal.git
   ```
2. Double-click `{{ theme.name }}-{{ first.variant.name }}.terminal`{% if variants | length > 1 %} (or {% for v in variants | slice(start=1) %}`{{ theme.name }}-{{ v.variant.name }}.terminal`{% if not loop.last %}, {% endif %}{% endfor %}){% endif %} to import the profile
3. Open Terminal > Settings > Profiles
4. Select the {{ theme.name }} theme and click "Default"

